ue = u128::from_ne_bytes(if cfg!(target_endian = \"big\") {\n    [0x12, 0x34, 0x56, 0x78, 0x90, 0x12, 0x34, 0x56, 0x78, 0x90, 0x12, 0x34, 0x56, 0x78, 0x90, 0x12]\n} else {\n    [0x12, 0x90, 0x78, 0x56, 0x34, 0x12, 0x90, 0x78, 0x56, 0x34, 0x12, 0x90, 0x78, 0x56, 0x34, 0x12]\n});\nassert_eq!(value, 0x12345678901234567890123456789012);\n```\n\nWhen starting from a slice rather than an array, fallible conversion APIs can be used:\n\n```\nfn read_ne_u128(input: &mut &[u8]) -> u128 {\n    let (int_bytes, rest) = input.split_at(size_of::<u128>());\n    *input = rest;\n    u128::from_ne_bytes(int_bytes.try_into().unwrap())\n}\n```","links":{"Self::from_le_bytes":50768,"Self::from_be_bytes":50767},"attrs":[{"other":"#[allow(unnecessary_transmutes)]"},{"other":"#[attr = ConstStability {stability: PartialConstStability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 44, patch: 0})}, feature: \"const_int_conversion\", promotable: false}}]"},{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 32, patch: 0})}, feature: \"int_to_from_bytes\"}}]"},{"other":"#[attr = Inline(Hint)]"},{"must_use":{"reason":null}}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["bytes",{"array":{"type":{"primitive":"u8"},"len":"16"}}]],"output":{"generic":"Self"},"is_c_variadic":false},"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"header":{"is_const":true,"is_unsafe":false,"is_async":false,"abi":"Rust"},"has_body":true}}},"11024":{"id":11024,"crate_id":0,"name":"try_from","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\convert\\mod.rs","begin":[702,5],"end":[702,56]},"visibility":"default","docs":"Performs the conversion.","links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[rustc_diagnostic_item = \"try_from_fn\"]"},{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 34, patch: 0})}, feature: \"try_from\"}}]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["value",{"ge