U16>>(), size_of::<u16>());\n```\n\n# Layout\n\n`NonZeroU16` is guaranteed to have the same layout and bit validity as `u16`\nwith the exception that `0` is not a valid instance.\n`Option<NonZeroU16>` is guaranteed to be compatible with `u16`,\nincluding in FFI.\n\nThanks to the [null pointer optimization],\n`NonZeroU16` and `Option<NonZeroU16>`\nare guaranteed to have the same size and alignment:\n\n```\nuse std::num::NonZeroU16;\n\nassert_eq!(size_of::<NonZeroU16>(), size_of::<Option<NonZeroU16>>());\nassert_eq!(align_of::<NonZeroU16>(), align_of::<Option<NonZeroU16>>());\n```\n\n# Compile-time creation\n\nSince both [`Option::unwrap()`] and [`Option::expect()`] are `const`, it is possible to\ndefine a new\n`NonZeroU16`\nat compile time via:\n```\nuse std::num::NonZeroU16;\n\nconst TEN: NonZeroU16 = NonZeroU16::new(10).expect(\"ten is non-zero\");\n```\n\n[null pointer optimization]: crate::option#representation","links":{"crate::option#representation":816,"`u16`":254,"`Option::unwrap()`":1944,"`Option::expect()`":1945},"attrs":[{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 28, patch: 0})}, feature: \"nonzero\"}}]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"type_alias":{"type":{"resolved_path":{"path":"NonZero","id":800,"args":{"angle_bracketed":{"args":[{"type":{"primitive":"u16"}}],"constraints":[]}}}},"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]}}}},"23745":{"id":23745,"crate_id":0,"name":null,"span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\iter\\adapters\\by_ref_sized.rs","begin":[9,10],"end":[9,15]},"visibility":"default","docs":null,"links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Unstable {reason: None,\nis_soft: false}, feature: \"std_internals\"}}]"},"automatically_derived"],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"impl":{"is_unsafe":false,"generics":{"params":[{"name":"'a","kind":{"lifetime":{"outlives":[]}}},{"name":"I","kind":{"type":{"bounds":[{"trait_bound":{"trait":{"path":"$crate::f