":[],"type":{"qualified_path":{"name":"Output","args":null,"self_type":{"primitive":"usize"},"trait":{"path":"Shr","id":4656,"args":null}}}}}},"41047":{"id":41047,"crate_id":0,"name":"_mm_mask_getmant_ph","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\..\\..\\stdarch\\crates\\core_arch\\src\\x86\\avx512fp16.rs","begin":[9264,1],"end":[9277,2]},"visibility":"public","docs":"Normalize the mantissas of packed half-precision (16-bit) floating-point elements in a, and store\nthe results in dst using writemask k (elements are copied from src when the corresponding mask bit is not set).\nThis intrinsic essentially calculates `±(2^k)*|x.significand|`, where k depends on the interval range defined\nby norm and the sign depends on sign and the source sign.\n\nThe mantissa is normalized to the interval specified by interv, which can take the following values:\n\n    _MM_MANT_NORM_1_2     // interval [1, 2)\n    _MM_MANT_NORM_p5_2    // interval [0.5, 2)\n    _MM_MANT_NORM_p5_1    // interval [0.5, 1)\n    _MM_MANT_NORM_p75_1p5 // interval [0.75, 1.5)\n\nThe sign is determined by sc which can take the following values:\n\n    _MM_MANT_SIGN_src     // sign = sign(src)\n    _MM_MANT_SIGN_zero    // sign = 0\n    _MM_MANT_SIGN_nan     // dst = NaN if sign(src) = 1\n\n[Intel's documentation](https://software.intel.com/sites/landingpage/IntrinsicsGuide/#text=_mm_mask_getmant_ph)","links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[<cfg_attr_trace>(test, assert_instr(vgetmantph, NORM = 0, SIGN = 0))]"},{"other":"#[rustc_legacy_const_generics(3, 4)]"},{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Unstable {reason: None,\nissue: 127213, is_soft: false}, feature: \"stdarch_x86_avx512_f16\"}}]"},{"target_feature":{"enable":["avx512fp16","avx512vl"]}},{"other":"#[attr = Inline(Hint)]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["src",{"resolved_path":{"path":"__m128h","id":9344,"args":null}}],["k",{"resolved_path":{"path":"__mmask8","id":35946,"args":null}}],["a",{"resolved_path":{"path":"__m128h","id":9344,"args":null}}],["NORM",{"resolved_path":{"path":"_MM_MANTISSA_NORM_ENUM","id":36447,"args":null}}],["SIGN",{"resolved_path":{"path":"_MM_MANTISSA_SIGN_ENUM","id":36448,"args":null}}]],"output":{"resolved_path":{"path":"__m128h","id":9344,"args":null}},"is_c_variadic":false},"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"header":{"is_const":false,"is_unsafe":false,"is_async":false,"abi":"Rust"},"has_body":true}}},"23100":{"id":23100,"crate_id":0,"name":null,"span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\any.rs","begin":[138,1],"end":[142,2]},"visibility":"default","docs":null,"links":{},"attrs":[],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"impl":{"is_unsafe":false,"generics":{"params":[{"name":"T","kind":{"type":{"bounds":[],"default":null,"is_synthetic":false}}}],"where_predicates":[{"bound_predicate":{"type":{"generic":"T"},"bounds":[{"outlives":"'static"},{"trait_bound":{"trait":{"path":"Sized","id":7,"args":null},"generic_params":[],"modifier":"maybe"}}],"generic_params":[]}}]},"provided_trait_methods":[],"trait":{"path":"Any","id":707,"args":null},"for":{"resolved_path":{"path":"BorrowError","id":11628,"args":null}},"items":[704],"is_negative":false,"is_synthetic":false,"blanket_impl":{"generic":"T"}}}},"44898":{"id":44898,"crate_id":0,"name":"lasx_xvseq_h","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\..\\..\\stdarch\\crates\\core_arch\\src\\loongarch64\\lasx\\generated.rs","begin":[2402,1],"end":[2404,2]},"visibility":"public","docs":null,"links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Unstable {reason: None,\nissue: 117427, is_soft: false}, feature: \"stdarch_loongarch\"}}]"},{"target_feature":{"enable":["lasx"]}},{"other":"#[attr = Inline(Hint)]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["a",{"resolved_path":{"path":"m256i","id":9431,"args":null}}],["b",{"resolved_path":{"path":"m256i","id":9431,"args":null}}]],"output":{"resolved_path":{"path":"m256i","id":9431,"args":null}},"is_c_variadic":false},"generics":{"pa